      "id": "claim_60d379bfef654ae3bb1cc011f1f6a29f",
      "statement": "Two setup files exist: ulabase.setup.ts configures accounts, feature flags, Google OAuth, and origin allowlist; ulabase.setup.consents.ts extends it by importing it and appending user schema, consent permission, JWT claims, and a Guards rule (451). Both are idempotent check-then-apply via the ulabase CLI.",
