      "statement": "ulabase.setup.consents.ts imports the entire accounts setup from ulabase.setup.ts, so the accounts steps have one definition and adding a step there reaches both files. Applying the consents file to a service already set up with ulabase.setup.ts adds the gate and touches nothing else.",
