      "id": "claim_a0ad6f435aa541e4b0276f0e126960a4",
      "statement": "The Guards rule blocks authenticated users with HTTP 451 when either consent version does not match, excluding /auth, /token, and the acceptance PATCH itself. /users/me is deliberately not excluded — blocking it is what makes the gate work with no probing on the client side.",
